      "settings": {
        "eyebrow": "About Us",
        "heading": "Healthcare That Sees the Bigger Picture. <em>You.</em>",
        "body": "<p><strong>Rooted in Medical Expertise. Focused on Your Future.</strong></p><p>At Chopin RX, we believe healthcare should go beyond treating symptoms. It should empower individuals to take a more proactive, personalized approach to their health.</p><p>Built on extensive industry experience and established relationships with doctors, healthcare professionals, and pharmacy partners, Chopin RX bridges the gap between evolving medical innovation and accessible, individualized care.</p><p>Through our premium telehealth platform, we connect individuals with independent, licensed U.S. clinicians to explore medically appropriate options in weight management, hormone health, peptide-focused therapies, and longevity.</p><p><strong>What sets us apart is our foundation:</strong> healthcare industry expertise, trusted professional relationships, and a commitment to transparency, clinical oversight, and the individual behind every treatment decision.</p><p><strong>Our Vision:</strong> To set a new standard in personalized telehealth and become the most trusted destination for informed, proactive healthcare.</p><p><strong>Chopin RX. Expertise You Can Trust. Care Built Around You.</strong></p>"
      }
