        "body": "<p>ChopinRX is a networking platform. It connects consumers with independent, licensed U.S. medical providers who make all prescribing decisions independently. ChopinRX does not employ these providers, does not direct their clinical decisions, and is not itself a medical provider.</p><p>Fulfillment is handled by licensed U.S.-based compounding pharmacies that follow USP testing and quality standards.</p>"
