        "heading": "<em>Trust</em> matters",
        "body": "<p>When it comes to health, trust is non-negotiable. That's why every part of ChopinRX is regulated, inspected, and verifiable.</p><p><strong>We are registered with:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Legitimate pharmacy programs</strong> — Our partner pharmacies are 503A & 503B licensed in the states they ship to and are inspected against national standards for safety and quality.</li><li><strong>Privacy-Focused Care</strong> — Your personal health information is handled with confidentiality, care, and discretion.</li></ul><p>Regulation is central to how we work, not a box to tick.</p><p><strong>Our practitioners are individually registered:</strong></p><ul><li>Prescribing clinicians — Licensed in the state where they practise</li><li>Dispensing pharmacists — Licensed with their state board of pharmacy</li></ul><p>You can verify any of our practitioners directly on their professional registers. We think that's exactly how it should be.</p>"
